        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual puzzle game features beautiful graphics that make up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Mount Wugong is a renowned 5A-level scenic spot in Jiangxi Province, famous for its natural landscapes such as alpine meadows, sea of clouds, and sunrise. Its main peak, Baihe Peak, stands at an altitude of 1,918 meters and boasts the highest and largest alpine meadow at the same latitude worldwide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204320/extras/7c3457a2cb6b1d9235c56afb68424e5c.avif?t=1765276526\" width=1000 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game starts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on 'start game', the image will be grayed out, and the colored parts will be randomly scrambled into 16 small fragments, scattered randomly on the screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game process:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players click on the small image, drag it to its original position to restore it, until all the small images move to the correct position, and the game ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End or start the next game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the small fragments move to the correct position, and the game ends. At this point, click &quot;try again&quot; to repeat the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
